/Title (Overall, this multi-tenancy design enables scalability, as new barbershops can be added without affecting existing ones, while maintaining high levels of data security, performance, and operational independence. )
/Dest [14 0 R /XYZ 90.09668 422.70459 0]
/Parent 691 0 R
/SE 133 0 R
/Prev 699 0 R
/Next 695 0 R
>>
endobj
699 0 obj
<<
/Title (The design also incorporates role-based access control \(RBAC\) within each tenant, allowing different users \(e.g., owner, manager, barber, customer\) to perform only authorized actions. Additionally, the system manages the tenant lifecycle, including states such as pending, active, inactive, and suspended, which control access to system features based on subscription status and administrative actions. )
/Dest [14 0 R /XYZ 90.123535 510.92627 0]
/Parent 691 0 R
/SE 132 0 R
/Prev 697 0 R
/Next 698 0 R
>>
